{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "EXO",
 "chapter": 29,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.3",
   "range": "EXO.29.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "226f6ec7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.3#p1-226f6ec7",
     "text": "To offer them in sacrifice.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "bring them in the basket"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.5",
   "range": "EXO.29.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f8746c59",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.5#p1-f8746c59",
     "text": "Which was next under the Ephod.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "robe of the ephod"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.10",
   "range": "EXO.29.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "192c048b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.10#p1-192c048b",
     "text": "Signifying that the sacrifice was also offered for them, and that they approved it.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "put their hands upon the head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.18",
   "range": "EXO.29.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0619d4fa",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.18#p1-0619d4fa",
     "text": "Or, savour of rest, which causes the wrath of God to cease.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "it is a sweet savour"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.20",
   "range": "EXO.29.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e3835743",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.20#p1-e3835743",
     "text": "Meaning the soft and lower part of the ear.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "upon the tip of the right"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.21",
   "range": "EXO.29.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ad841df8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.21#p1-ad841df8",
     "text": "With which the Altar must be sprinkled.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "upon the altar"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.22",
   "range": "EXO.29.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "046bad4c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.22#p1-046bad4c",
     "text": "Which is offered for the consecration of the high priest.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "ram of consecration"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.26",
   "range": "EXO.29.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e2b2edda",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.26#p1-e2b2edda",
     "text": "This sacrifice the priest did move toward the East, West, North, and South.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "for a wave offering before the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.27",
   "range": "EXO.29.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "19c3b3ee",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.27#p1-19c3b3ee",
     "text": "So called because it was not only shaken to and fro, but also lifted up.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "heave offering"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.28",
   "range": "EXO.29.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "95ccac96",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.28#p1-95ccac96",
     "text": "Which were offerings of thanksgiving to God for his benefits.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "peace offerings"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.33",
   "range": "EXO.29.33",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c3d596ce",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.33#p1-c3d596ce",
     "text": "That is, by the sacrifices.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "wherewith the atonement was made"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.36",
   "range": "EXO.29.36",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "af4136a3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.36#p1-af4136a3",
     "text": "To appease God's wrath that sin may be pardoned.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "atonement"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.40",
   "range": "EXO.29.40",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ad7acaa6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.40#p1-090ab000",
     "text": "That is, an Omer, read Ex 16:16.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "tenth deal of flour mingled with",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 16:16",
       "ref": "EXO.16.16"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.40#p2-17cf2ad4",
     "text": "Which is about a pint.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "hin of beaten oil"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.43",
   "range": "EXO.29.43",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e7dc49c8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.43#p1-e7dc49c8",
     "text": "Because of my glorious presence.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "glory"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.29.46",
   "range": "EXO.29.46",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ea2bd6fa",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.29.46#p1-ea2bd6fa",
     "text": "It is I the Lord, that am their God.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "I am the LORD their God"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
